0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">DeepSeek-V4.1-Flash-1017是深度求索推出的轻量级高性能大语言模型。该模型定位为高效推理版本，旨在通过优化架构和参数规模，在保持强大文本理解与逻辑推理能力的同时，大幅提升响应速度，适合高并发、低延迟的实时对话及自动化处理任务。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;padding:12px 16px;background:linear-gradient(135deg,#ea580c 0%,#fb923c 100%);\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;line-height:1.4;color:#ffffff;font-weight:700;\">#2 Trending Model</span><span style=\"font-size:12px;line-height:1.4;color:rgba(255,255,255,0.88);\">Hugging Face</span></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:0;width:100%;line-height:0;\"><img src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-model-hub/main/assets/huggingface_model_cards/2026-10-29/02-recursivesi-flint.png\" alt=\"RecursiveSI/flint\" style=\"display:block;width:100%;height:auto;border:0;margin:0;padding:0;\" /></section><section style=\"margin:0;padding:16px 16px 18px;background-color:#ffffff;\"><h2 style=\"margin:0 0 10px;font-size:19px;line-height:1.45;color:#111827;font-weight:700;word-break:break-word;\">RecursiveSI/flint</h2><p style=\"margin:0 0 14px;font-size:14px;line-height:1.85;color:#374151;text-align:left;word-break:break-word;\">Flint是由RecursiveSI开发的模型，其设计侧重于特定场景下的任务执行效率。作为一款精简高效的模型，它旨在平衡计算成本与输出质量，适用于资源受限的环境下进行文本分析、轻量级指令遵循以及各类垂直领域的自动化处理需求。</p></section></section><section style=\"margin:0 0 24px;padding:0;width:100%;background-color:#ffffff;border-top:1px solid #f3f4f6;border-bottom:1px solid #f3f4f6;\"><section style=\"display:flex;align-item